		sections={
			{id=2371,title="Quicksilver Armor",body="Karsh Steelbender's Quicksilver Armor reduces all damage taken by $75842s1% when cooled."},
			{id=2372,title="Superheated Quicksilver Armor",body="When Karsh Steelbender moves under the stream of molten metal in the center of the room, his Quicksilver armor begins to heat up. This immediately removes the cooled Quicksilver Armor from him and replaces it with Superheated Quicksilver Armor. The Superheated Quicksilver Armor increases his damage taken by $75846s2% for $75846d. The effect continues to stack for every second he is under the molten stream.\n\nWhen the duration of Superheated Quicksilver Armor expires, the armor cools off and Karsh gains the Quicksilver Armor effect."},
			{id=2373,title="Heat Wave",body="Every second Karsh Steelbender is under the molten stream of metal, his armor emits a Heat Wave. This inflicts $75851s1 Fire damage to all nearby enemies, but the damage is further multiplied by the number of stacks of Superheated Quicksilver Armor on Karsh."},
			{id=2374,title="Burning Metal",body="When Karsh Steelbender's Quicksilver Armor is superheated, he inflicts $76002s1 Fire damage to his current enemy target whenever he swings his weapon at them. This damage is multiplied by the number of stacks of Superheated Quicksilver Armor on Karsh."},
			{id=2375,title="Cleave",body="Karsh Steelbender swings his glaive in a wild arc, inflicting $15284s1% of his normal melee damage to his current melee target and two other nearby targets within melee distance of Karsh."},
			{id=2376,title="Lava Spout",body="When the duration of Superheated Quicksilver Armor expires, Karsh Steelbender's armor cools off and the excess heat causes lava spouts to erupt from the circular grate inside the room. Players standing on the grate when the lava spouts erupt take $76007s1 Fire damage."},
			{id=2377,title="Bound Flames",body="When the lava spouts erupt from the circular grate, three Bound Flames form and begin to attack nearby enemy players.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
		},
	},
	[108]={
		encounterID=108,
		instanceID=66,
		order=4,
		name="Beauty",
		lore="Beauty's past is a tale as old as time, a song as old as rhyme. After Beauty's mate, Beast, was slain by heroes in Blackrock Spire, the hound and its four remaining pups joined forces with the Twilight's Hammer, intent on punishing the creatures who killed its mate.",
