		sections={
			{id=2405,title="Ground Slam",body="Ozruk builds up his strength then slams the ground in front of him dealing $78903s1 Physical damage to all enemies within $78903A1 yards of the impact point."},
			{id=2406,title="Rupture",body="When Ozruk performs a Ground Slam in Heroic Difficulty, the ground ruptures and causes three lines of rock spikes to erupt in the direction he is facing. Any player caught by one of the rock spikes is dealt $92381s1 Physical damage and is knocked upwards.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2407,title="Elementium Bulwark",body="The elementium plates grafted onto Ozruk are charged with energy, causing them to have a $78939s1% chance to reflect spells for $78939d."},
			{id=2408,title="Elementium Spike Shield",body="Spikes erupt from Ozruk's body for $78835d. Any player who attacks Ozruk with a melee or ranged attack while he has the Elementium Spike Shield are inflicted with a bleed effect that deals $78859s1 Arcane damage every second for $78859d. This effect stacks up to 5 times, but may only be applied once per second."},
			{id=2409,title="Shatter",body="When the Elementium Spike Shield expires, Ozruk shatters the spikes and launches them in all directions. This inflicts $78807s1 Physical damage to all enemies within $78807A1 yards."},
			{id=2410,title="Paralyze",body="Right before Ozruk uses his Shatter ability, Ozruk will cast Paralyze. The Paralyze spell stuns all enemies for $92426d. Any damage taken while stunned will remove the Paralyze effect. If Paralyze is not prematurely removed, then at the end of the spell's duration the player is dealt $94661s1 Arcane damage.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
