			{itemID=55864,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=55865,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=2455,title="Stage One: Begone Infidels!"},
			{id=2456,title="Fifty Lashings",body="High Prophet Barim punishes his current enemy with Fifty Lashings. Barim's next 10 melee swings that deal damage inflict an additional $82522s1 Physical damage."},
			{id=2457,title="Plague of Ages",body="High Prophet Barim hurls a bolt of cursed blight that targets a random player then jumps to hit two more random players. The bolt inflicts $82622s1 Nature damage and an additional $82622s2 Nature damage every $82622t2 seconds for $82622d."},
			{id=2458,title="Heaven's Fury",body="High Prophet Barim opens up the heavens at the location of a random player. The light from above inflicts $81942s2 Holy damage every $81941t1 seconds to every player within $81942A2 yards of the location for 9 seconds."},
			{id=2459,title="Blaze of the Heavens",body="High Prophet Barim summons a fiery phoenix to join the fight. If the Blaze of the Heavens reaches 1% remaining health, it transforms into a phoenix egg and begins to heal. After approximately 20 seconds, the egg will hatch into a new Blaze of the Heavens.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2460,title="Blaze of the Heavens",body="The phoenix inflicts $95249s1 Fire damage every $95248t1 seconds to any player within $95249A1 yards. The phoenix slowly immolates herself, losing $95249s2% of its health every $95248t1 seconds.\n\nThe phoenix also creates small $91196A1 yard radius patches of fire on the ground underneath her every $91185t1 seconds. The patches inflict $91196s1 Fire damage to any player standing within them.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2461,title="Repentance",body="When High Prophet Barim's remaining health reaches 50%, Barim pulls every player to him and forces them to kneel in front of him while stunned for $81947d. Barim then rips your soul apart, banishing your soul to the darkness and triggering stage two of the encounter.\n\nAn area of hallowed ground also opens up around Barim, and this ground inflicts $88814s1 Holy damage every $82320t1 second to any player standing within $88814A1 yards of the ground's center."},
			{id=2462,title="Stage Two: Kneel and Repent",body="After High Prophet Barim casts Repentance, he becomes immune to damage and players find themselves in a realm of darkness. Players must defeat the Harbinger of Darkness to end stage two, return to their normal bodies, and continue the fight against Barim."},
			{id=2473,title="Harbinger of Darkness",body="Defeating this dark phoenix ends stage two."},
			{id=2463,title="Wail of Darkness",body="The Harbinger periodically inflicts $82533s2 Shadow damage to every player."},
			{id=2464,title="Soul Sever",body="The Harbinger of Darkness severs the soul of a random player, creating a Soul Fragment. The Soul Fragment then moves towards the Harbinger of Darkness. If the Soul Fragment reaches the Harbinger it will cast Merged Souls."},
			{id=2465,title="Soul Fragment",body="These creatures have low health and move slowly."},
			{id=2466,title="Merged Souls",body="If a Soul Fragment reaches the Harbinger of Darkness, the Soul Fragment will heal the Harbinger for $82263s1 and increase the size and damage dealt by the Harbinger by $82263s3%. After casting this spell, the Soul Fragment disappears."},
		},
	},
