		sections={
			{id=3166,title="Anshal",body="Anshal has zero wind energy at the beginning of the encounter. He regains 1 wind energy every second, and when he reaches 90 wind energy, he casts Zephyr."},
			{id=3167,title="Nurture",body="Anshal summons a Ravenous Creeper every second for $85422d."},
			{id=3168,title="Ravenous Creeper",body="Ravenous Creepers periodically release Toxic Spores until killed."},
			{id=3169,title="Toxic Spores",body="Toxic Spores erupt from Ravenous Creepers every $86281t1 sec. for $86281d, afflicting all enemies within $86282A1 yards with a deadly toxin. The toxin inflicts $86282s1 Nature damage every second for $86282d. This effect stacks up to 25 times."},
			{id=3170,title="Soothing Breeze",body="Anshal summons an area of calm winds at the location of a random Ravenous Creeper that lasts 30 sec. This $95218A1 yard radius area heals Anshal and his Ravenous Creepers for $86206s1 per second. Any enemies standing within the area are silenced and pacified."},
			{id=3171,title="Zephyr",body="When Anshal accumulates 90 wind energy he casts Zephyr, which heals all Ravenous Creepers within $84651A1 yards for $84651s2 health per second. The Zephyr also increases the damage dealt by Ravenous Creepers by $84651s3% for $84651d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=3172,title="Rohash",body="Rohash has zero wind energy at the beginning of the encounter. He regains 1 wind energy every second, and when he reaches 90 wind energy, he casts Hurricane."},
			{id=3173,title="Slicing Gale",body="Rohash's fierce winds slice through a random player, inflicting $86182s1 Nature damage.$[!5,6\n\nOn Heroic Difficulty, Slicing Gale also increases the player's Nature damage taken by $86182s2% for 45 sec. This effect stacks.$]"},
			{id=3174,title="Wind Blast",body="Rohash slowly rotates in place and blasts players in front of him with wind for $85480d, inflicting $85483s2 Nature damage and knocking players back."},
			{id=3175,title="Tornado",body="Rohash summons tornadoes that randomly move around the platform, inflicting $86133s1 Nature damage to any player within $86133A1 yards and knocking them back."},
			{id=3176,title="Hurricane",body="When Rohash accumulates 90 wind energy he casts Hurricane, creating a huge vortex of wind. The Hurricane catches all nearby players and launches them into the air, inflicting $86487s1 Nature damage per second for $84643d. The players then drop out of the air, possibly taking additional falling damage."},
			{id=3177,title="Storm Shield",body="When Rohash accumulates 30 wind energy he casts Storm Shield. The shield absorbs $93059s1 damage and inflicts $93060s1 Nature damage per second to all players on his platform.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=3178,title="Nezir",body="Nezir has zero wind energy at the beginning of the encounter. He regains 1 wind energy every second, and when he reaches 90 wind energy, he casts Sleet Storm."},
			{id=3179,title="Wind Chill",body="Nezir inflicts $84645s1 Frost damage to all players within $84645A1 yards and increases their Frost damage taken by $84645s2% for $84645d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=3180,title="Permafrost",body="Nezir channels a blast of Frost in the direction of his current target, inflicting $86081s1 Frost damage every $86082t1 second to players within the 50 degree cone for $86082d."},
			{id=3181,title="Ice Patch",body="Nezir summons Ice Patches at the location of a random player on his platform that last $86111d. Ice Patches inflict $86111s1 Frost damage every $86107t1 second to all players within $86111A1 yards, and slows their movement speed by $86111s2%. This effect stacks."},
			{id=3182,title="Sleet Storm",body="When Nezir accumulates 90 wind energy he casts Sleet Storm, which inflicts $86367s1 Frost damage per second to all players within $86367A1 yards for $84644d. The damage is divided among all targets."},
		},
	},
