		},
		sections={
			{id=2994,title="Theralion",body="When the encounter begins, Theralion immediately takes to the air, while Valiona engages the attackers on the ground.  The twin dragons share a single health pool, and each alternates between being airborne and fighting on the ground."},
			{id=2995,title="Grounded Abilities",body="Theralion uses the following abilities while on the ground."},
			{id=2996,title="Engulfing Magic",body="Theralion twists the magical energies within an enemy spellcaster, increasing their damage and healing done by $86622s1% for $86622d.\n\nHowever, each time the affected player deals damage or healing, Engulfing Magic triggers a twilight explosion. The blast causes damage equal to the amount of damage or healing dealt to all players within $86631A1 yards.$[!4,6\n\nIn a 25 player raid, Theralion twists the magical energies of three enemy spellcasters.$]"},
			{id=2997,title="Fabulous Flames",body="Theralion launches a burst of twilight energy at the location of a random enemy. Fabulous Flames leave a circular patch of twilight fire on the ground for $86503d., inflicting $86505s1 Shadow damage every $86506t1 sec. to all players in a $86505A1 yard radius."},
			{id=3006,title="Twilight Shift",body="Theralion periodically applies Twilight Shift to his current target. This effect stacks. When Theralion applies a fifth stack to the same target, he casts Shifting Reality on the target.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=2998,title="Shifting Reality",body="When Theralion applies a fifth stack of Twilight Shift to a target, Shifting Reality inflicts $93055s1 Shadow damage to all players within $93055A1 yards, and draws the affected players into the Twilight Realm.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=2999,title="Airborne Abilities",body="Theralion uses the following abilities while in the air."},
			{id=3001,title="Twilight Blast",body="While hovering overhead, Theralion continually launches bolts of twilight flame at the locations of random players. When a Twilight Blast impacts the ground, it explodes and inflicts $86371s1 Shadow damage to all players within $86371A1 yards of the impact location."},
			{id=3000,title="Dazzling Destruction",body="As he prepares to land, Theralion mesmerizes his foes with swirling patterns of energy on the ground. Theralion then strikes each of these locations with massive blasts of twilight power, inflicting $86406s1 Shadow damage to players within $86406A1 yards and sending anyone caught in the blast into the Twilight Realm. If a player is already in the Twilight Realm when struck by Dazzling Destruction, that player dies."},
			{id=2985,title="Valiona",body="When the encounter begins, Theralion immediately takes to the air, while Valiona engages the attackers on the ground.  The twin dragons share a single health pool, and each alternate between being airborne and fighting on the ground."},
			{id=2986,title="Grounded Abilities",body="Valiona uses the following abilities while on the ground."},
			{id=2987,title="Blackout",body="Valiona surrounds a random player in a shroud of Twilight energy, absorbing the next $86788s1 points of healing on the target. When Blackout expires or a player dispels the effect, the dark energy explodes in a massive torrent. The explosion inflicts $86825s1 Shadow damage divided amongst all players within $86825A1 yards."},
			{id=2988,title="Devouring Flames",body="Valiona unleashes a prolonged breath of Twilight flame in the direction of a random player. Devouring Flames inflicts up to $86844s1 Shadow damage every $86840t1 sec. for $86840d. The damage diminishes on targets within the breath the farther away from Valiona they are located."},
			{id=2989,title="Twilight Shift",body="Valiona periodically applies Twilight Shift to her current target. This effect stacks. When Valiona applies a fifth stack to the same target, she casts Shifting Reality on the target.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=2990,title="Shifting Reality",body="When Valiona applies a fifth stack of Twilight Shift to a target, Shifting Reality inflicts $93055s1 Shadow damage to all players within $93055A1 yards, and draws the affected players into the Twilight Realm.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=2991,title="Airborne Abilities",body="Valiona uses the following abilities while in the air."},
			{id=2992,title="Twilight Meteorite",body="Valiona sets her sights upon a random player and prepares to unleash a powerful Twilight Meteorite on them. When the meteorite lands on the player, it inflicts $86014s1 Shadow damage divided amongst players within $86014A1 yards of the impact point."},
			{id=2993,title="Deep Breath",body="As she prepares to land, Valiona takes a deep breath and strafes from one end of the chamber to the other, engulfing a third of the room in Twilight Flames. Contact with this dark flame inflicts $86199s1 Shadow damage, and draws the player into the Twilight Realm. If the player is already in the Twilight Realm when struck by Deep Breath, that player dies."},
			{id=3002,title="Twilight Realm",body="Being struck by Theralion's Dazzling Destruction or Valiona's Deep Breath pulls players into the Twilight Realm. In this alternate plane of existence, spheres of volatile twilight energy float around and detonate if touched. Collapsing portals appear randomly throughout the area, and players may use a portal to return to the material plane. Each portal disappates after a time.$[!5,6\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty Shifting Reality also pulls players into the Twilight Realm.$]"},
			{id=3003,title="Twilight Sentry",body="On Heroic Difficulty the Twilight Realm is populated by the mysterious Twilight Sentries. Visible only as shimmers of twilight to those in the material plane, Twilight Sentries strike out indiscriminately, firing Rift Blasts at players both inside and outside the Twilight Realm.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=3004,title="Rift Blast",body="Twilight Sentries continually fire Rift Blasts at random players, inflicting $93019s1 Shadow damage every $93010t1 sec.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=3005,title="Twilight Zone",body="Players trapped in the Twilight Realm suffer $86214s1 Shadow damage every $86210t2 sec. The effect stacks, and the damage inflicted increases by $86214s2% with each additional application.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=3007,title="Unstable Twilight",body="Coming into contact with one of the floating orbs of twilight energy within the Twilight Realm causes it to violently explode. Unstable Twilight inflicts $86305s1 Shadow damage to all players within $86305A1 yards, but only affects players inside the Twilight Realm."},
		},
	},
	[158]={
