		},
		sections={
			{id=3008,title="Pip Quickwit",body="Pip Quickwit, gnome explorer extraordinare, has been captured by Nefarian and cannot be freed from his cage until Chimaeron is slain. A player can talk to Pip before the fight begins to convince him to activate his Bile-O-Tron, which helps keep the raid alive. Activating the Bile-O-Tron also wakes Chimaeron."},
			{id=3009,title="Bile-O-Tron",body="When Pip activates the Bile-O-Tron, it moves about the room and sprays raid members with Pip's Mixture as long as it is active. Chimaeron periodically knocks the Bile-O-Tron offline."},
			{id=3010,title="Pip's Mixture",body="The Bile-O-Tron sprays Pip's Mixture on the raid while online. Pip's Mixture prevents players whose health is above $82705s1% from dropping below 1 health."},
			{id=3011,title="Stage One: Truly Something to Behold",body="Chimaeron attacks his current target with Break and Double Attack, while continually spraying Caustic Slime at the raid. He periodically casts Massacre on the raid, and his heads sometimes Feud following a Massacre."},
			{id=3012,title="Caustic Slime",body="Chimaeron lobs Caustic Slime at two random players.  Each Caustic Slime inflicts $82935s1 Nature damage, divided evenly among all players within $82935A1 yards of the target. Caustic Slime also reduces chance to hit by $82935s2% for $82935d.$[!4,6\n\nIn 25 player raids Chimaeron lobs Caustic Slime at five random players.$]"},
			{id=3013,title="Massacre",body="Chimaeron hits all players for massive damage, probably killing anyone not under the effects of Pip's Mixture.\n\nMassacre sometimes knocks the Bile-O-Tron offline for a short period of time."},
			{id=3014,title="Feud",body="Whenever Chimaeron knocks the Bile-O-Tron offline, his two heads begin to argue with each other, preventing Chimaeron from perfoming melee attacks for $88872d. $[!5,6\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty Lord Victor Nefarius orders Chimaeron to stop his bickering, ending Feud after only 2 seconds.$]"},
			{id=3015,title="Break",body="Chimaeron attacks viciously, breaking through his target's defenses and increasing their Physical damage taken by $82881s1% and reducing healing done by $82881s2% for $82881d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=3016,title="Double Attack",body="Chimaeron strikes twice with his next attack."},
			{id=3017,title="Stage Two: A Horrific Creation",body="At 20% health Chimaeron goes into a rage. This renders him immune to Taunt effects and greatly decreases healing done by players."},
			{id=3018,title="Mortality",body="Chimaeron goes into a rage, rendering him immune to Taunt effects. In addition, he reduces healing effects done to players by $82890s1%.$[!3,5\n\nIn 10 player raids Chimaeron takes $82934s3% increased damage while Mortality is active.$]"},
			{id=3019,title="Double Attack",body="Chimaeron strikes twice with his next attack."},
			{id=3020,title="Mocking Shadows",body="Lord Victor Nefarius inflicts $91307s1 Shadow damage every second to all players.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
		},
	},
