		sections={
			{id=2899,title="Stage One: Welcome to the Great Show!",body="Jin'do fights players alone, dropping Deadzones on the ground to protect himself and calling upon the Spirit of Hakkar to empower his weapon with shadow lightning.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2900,title="Deadzone",body="Jin'do creates a field of deadened magic on the ground at his feet. All units in this field take $97170s1% less magic damage, but have their casting speed reduced by $101360s1%.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2901,title="Shadows of Hakkar",body="Jin'do draws power from the Spirit of Hakkar to charge his weapon. For the next $97172d. his attacks unleash bursts of energy that chain to additional targets, inflicting $97173s1 Shadow damage. Each additional target in the chain takes 85% less damage.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2902,title="Stage Two: Spitting in the Face of a God",body="Jin'do drags his enemies with him into the spirit world. He draws tremendous power from Hakkar's spirit, which is held captive by three large chains.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2903,title="Shadow Spike",body="Jin'do hurls a bolt of shadow at a random player's location. The spike explodes when it hits the ground, inflicting $97161s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $97161a1 yards.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2904,title="Gurubashi Spirit",body="Gurubashi Spirits appear in the spirit world wherever players defeat Gurubashi Spirit Warriors in the living world.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2905,title="Frenzy",body="Gurubashi Spirits periodically gain $97088s1% attack speed. This effect stacks.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2906,title="Body Slam",body="The Gurubashi Spirit jumps to a random target's location, inflicting $97252s1 damage to all units and other objects within $97252A1 yards of that location and knocking them back. This attack leaves a Sundered Rift on the ground, increasing the damage taken by units and objects in the $97320A1 yard radius area by $97320s1% for 20 seconds.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2907,title="Sunder Rift",body="The Gurubashi Spirit's Body Slam attack leaves a Sunder Rift on the ground, increasing the damage taken by units and objects in the area by $97320s1% for 20 seconds.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2908,title="Twisted Spirit",body="Twisted Spirits swarm out of portals around the temple and attack players in increasing numbers. Twisted Spirits inflict Shadow damage when they attack. These creatures have very low health.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2909,title="Hakkar's Chains",body="Jin'do will not feel the fury of Hakkar's vengeance until all three of Hakkar's Chains are destroyed.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
			{id=2910,title="Brittle Barrier",body="A barrier of arcane energy protects Hakkar's Chains and grants them immunity to all attacks and spells. Nothing short of an enormous Gurubashi troll spirit performing a Body Slam can break the barrier.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
