		sections={
			{id=20808,title="Overview",body="Shannox will not appear until you have slain a large number of the enemies in the zone.\n\nOnce engaged, Shannox will attack you with his two companions: Rageface and Riplimb. Shannox will throw his spear and lay down Crystal Prison Traps periodically while Rageface attacks players at random and Riplimb must be tanked.\n\nWhen either Rageface or Riplimb are defeated, Shannox will Frenzy.  When Shannox is defeated, both Rageface and Riplimb will gain Frenzied Devotion."},
			{id=20809,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Shannox and Riplimb are immune to Taunt mechanics.\n$bullet;Rageface fixates on targets at random.\n$bullet;Use the time when Riplimb retrieves Shannox's spear to reset your applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99937|h[Jagged Tear]|h|r."},
			{id=20810,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Rageface fixates on targets at random.\n$bullet;Victims of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99947|h[Face Rage]|h|r will need significant healing."},
			{id=20811,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Rageface can be imprisoned by the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99836|h[Crtystal Prison Traps]|h|r Shannox drops on the ground.\n$bullet;Rageface will fixate on random members of your raid.\n$bullet;Bring down all three targets at nearly the same time to avoid the extra damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:23537|h[Frenzy]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:100064|h[Frenzied Devotion]|h|r."},
			{id=2575,title="Immolation Trap",body="Shannox launches a fiery trap at a random player's location. The trap arms after 2 seconds, then detonates when either a player or one of Shannox's pets steps over the trap. Immolation Trap inflicts $99838s1 Fire damage, $99838s2 Fire damage every $99838t2 sec., and increases the target's damage taken by $99838s3% for $99838d."},
			{id=2576,title="Crystal Prison Trap",body="Shannox launches a prison trap at a random player's location. The trap arms after 2 seconds, then detonates when either a player or one of Shannox's pets steps over the trap. The Crystal Prison trap encases the target in a block of magma crystal, preventing all movement and any other action. Destroying the crystal prison frees a trapped player."},
			{id=2577,title="Arcing Slash",body="Shannox inflicts $99931s1% of normal melee damage in a 120 degree cone up to $99931a1 yards in front of him, and inflicts Jagged Tear on his current target."},
			{id=2578,title="Jagged Tear",body="Shannox's Arcing Slash leaves a Jagged Tear that inflicts $99937s1 Physical damage every $99937t1 sec. for $99937d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=2579,title="Hurl Spear",body="Shannox hurls his spear at a location near Riplimb. When the spear lands it inflicts $100002s2 Physical damage to all enemies within $100002A2 yards and $100495s1 Fire damage to all enemies within $100495A1 yards.  The spear strike also triggers a cascade of molten eruptions around the impact location, inflicting $99842s1 Fire damage to enemies caught in an eruption.  \n\nRiplimb will then break off from combat, fetch the spear, and return it to Shannox."},
			{id=2580,title="Frenzy",body="When the players defeat Riplimb or Rageface, Shannox enters a frenzy. This increases his Physical damage by $100522s1% and attack speed by $100522s2%. This effect stacks twice."},
			{id=2928,title="Magma Rupture",body="Once Riplimb has been slain, Shannox drives his spear into the ground instead of hurling it. This attack inflicts $99840s2 Fire damage and increases the Fire damage taken for all players by $99840s3% for $99840d. The spear strike also triggers a cascade of molten eruptions around the impact location, inflicting $99842s1 Fire damage to enemies caught in an eruption."},
			{id=2581,title="Riplimb",body="Riplimb will attack the target with the most threat.\n\n$[!5,6,15 In Heroic Difficulty Riplimb cannot be permanently slain while his master lives. When his health reaches zero, he will collapse for 30 seconds, and then reanimate at full health to resume fighting.$]"},
			{id=2582,title="Limb Rip",body="Riplimb savagely bites his current target, inflicting $99832s1% of normal melee damage and inflicting Jagged Tear."},
			{id=2587,title="Jagged Tear",body="Riplimb's Limb Rip leaves a Jagged Tear that inflicts $99937s1 Physical damage every $99937t1 sec. for $99937d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=2588,title="Frenzied Devotion",body="Riplimb enters an unstoppable rage if he witnesses Shannox's health reach 30%. This effect increases Riplimb's damage dealt by $100064s1%, attack speed by $100064s2% and movement speed by $100064s3%."},
			{id=2589,title="Feeding Frenzy",body="Riplimb's successful melee attacks increase his physical damage dealt by $100656s1% for $100656d. This effect stacks.",difficultyIDs={5,6,15}},
			{id=2583,title="Rageface",body="Rageface cannot be controlled, and darts about from enemy to enemy, changing targets periodically."},
			{id=2584,title="Face Rage",body="Rageface leaps at a random player, stunning and knocking them to the ground. Rageface begins to viciously maul the player, inflicting $99947s2 Physical damage every $99947t2 sec. and the damage dealt increases over time.  While Rageface mauls the player, all attacks against the beast will be critical strikes.\n  \nRageface will continue the mauling until his target is dead, or until he has taken ${$100129s2/100}.1% of total health."},
			{id=2585,title="Frenzied Devotion",body="Rageface enters an unstoppable rage if he witnesses Shannox's health reach 30%. This effect increases Riplimb's damage dealt by $100064s1%, attack speed by $100064s2% and movement speed by $100064s3%."},
			{id=2586,title="Feeding Frenzy",body="Rageface's successful melee attacks increase his physical damage dealt by $100656s1% for $100656d. This effect stacks.",difficultyIDs={5,6,15}},
		},
	},
