		sections={
			{id=20834,title="Overview",body="This encounter spans three stages, separated by two intermissions. Ragnaros will attack players from his lava pool during each stage, and will submerge below during the intermissions."},
			{id=20835,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Ragnaros will use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98313|h[Magma Blast]|h|r if his tank target isn't in melee range.\n$bullet;Manage your applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99399|h[Burning Wound]|h|r so that |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99400|h[Burning Blast]|h|r doesn't become lethal.\n$bullet;Lava Scions that spawn during intermission two need to be tanked.\n$bullet;When targeted for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98498|h[Molten Seed]|h|r place the seed away from the raid to minimize the damage of the resultant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98518|h[Molten Inferno]|h|r.\n$bullet;Molten Elementals fixate on random raid members and cannot be tanked."},
			{id=20836,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Tanks will take high amounts of damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99399|h[Burning Wound]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99400|h[Burning Blast]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:98164|h[Magma Trap]|h|r is the largest source of raid damage.\n$bullet;Any players who fail to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98928|h[Lava Waves]|h|r will need immediate attention to survive.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:98237|h[Hand of Ragnaros]|h|r will damage all melee damage dealers.  The knockback will cancel your casting if you are too close to Ragnaros.\n$bullet;Stand apart from your raid members to minimize |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98263|h[Wrath of Ragnaros]|h|r knocking you back.\n$bullet;When targeted for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98498|h[Molten Seed]|h|r place the seed away from the raid to minimize the damage of the resultant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98518|h[Molten Inferno]|h|r."},
			{id=20837,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid triggering |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98164|h[Magma Trap]|h|r due to the knockback of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98237|h[Hand of Ragnaros]|h|r.\n$bullet;Spread out to avoid hitting multiple players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98263|h[Wrath of Ragnaros]|h|r.\n$bullet;Kill Sons of Flame before they reach Sulfuras or they will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99112|h[Supernova]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:98164|h[Magma Trap]|h|r will launch you high enough to make the fall fatal.\n$bullet;When targeted for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98498|h[Molten Seed]|h|r place the seed away from the raid to minimize the damage of the resultant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98518|h[Molten Inferno]|h|r.\n$bullet;Stand apart from your raid members to minimize |cFF2959D3|Hspell:98263|h[Wrath of Ragnaros]|h|r knocking you back.\n$bullet;Living Meteors can be forced to change target by damaging them while they are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:99296|h[Combustible]|h|r."},
			{id=2629,title="Stage One: By Fire Be Purged!"},
			{id=2630,title="Sulfuras Smash",body="Ragnaros faces the location of a random player and prepares to smash Sulfuras on the platform. The impact of Sulfuras inflicts $98708s1 Fire damage to any player within $98708A1 yards of the impact, and creates several Lava Waves which move out from the point of impact."},
			{id=2631,title="Lava Wave",body="If a player touches a moving Lava Wave, the lava inflicts $98928s1 Fire damage, $98928s2 Fire damage every $98928t2 sec. for $98928d., and knocks the player back."},
			{id=2632,title="Wrath of Ragnaros",body="Ragnaros blasts the location of a random player, inflicting $98263s1 Fire damage to all players within $98263A1 yards and knocking them back."},
			{id=2633,title="Hand of Ragnaros",body="Ragnaros inflicts $98237s1 Fire damage to all enemies within $98237A1 yards, knocking them back."},
			{id=2634,title="Magma Trap",body="Ragnaros launches a Magma Trap at a random player's location. When the Magma Trap reaches the platform, it inflicts $98170s1 Fire damage and knocks back players within $98170A1 yards. The active Magma Trap persists for the duration of the encounter and triggers when stepped on, causing a Magma Trap Eruption."},
			{id=2635,title="Magma Trap Eruption",body="A triggered Magma Trap erupts for $98175s1 Fire damage to all players, and violently knocks the triggering player into the air.$[!5,6,15\n\nThe Magma Trap causes the triggering player to take $100238s1% more damage from other Magma Traps. This effect lasts for $100238d and stacks.$]"},
			{id=3535,title="Magma Blast",body="Ragnaros blasts magma at his current target if he cannot reach and melee them, inflicting $98313s1 Fire damage and increasing Fire damage taken by $98313s2% for $98313d."},
			{id=2636,title="Intermission: Minions of Fire!",body="At 70% health Ragnaros casts Splitting Blow, burying Sulfuras into the platform and creating Sons of Flame across the platform.  Ragnaros submerges for 45 seconds or until the players destroy all the Sons of Flame, whichever comes first."},
			{id=2678,title="Splitting Blow",body="Ragnaros buries Sulfuras within the platform, inflicting $100455s1 Fire damage every $100456t1 second to players within $100455A1 yards and creating eight Sons of Flame that attempt to reach the mighty hammer."},
			{id=2637,title="Son of Flame",body="Sons of Flame cross the platform and attempt to reform with Sulfuras. A Son of Flame that reaches Sulfuras causes a Supernova."},
			{id=2638,title="Burning Speed",body="For every 5% of their remaining health above 50%, Sons of Flame move $99414s2% faster. When players reduce a Son of Flame to below 50% remaining health, the Son of Flame loses the Burning Speed effect."},
			{id=2639,title="Supernova",body="When a Son of Flame reaches Sulfuras it explodes in a Supernova, inflicting $99112s1 Fire damage to all players."},
			{id=3534,title="Lava Bolt",body="While Ragnaros lies submerged underneath the lava, bolts of hot magma fall on several random players every $98982t1 seconds. A Lava Bolt inflicts $98981s1 Fire Damage."},
			{id=2640,title="Stage Two: Sulfuras Will Be Your End!"},
			{id=2641,title="Sulfuras Smash",body="Ragnaros faces the location of a random player and prepares to smash Sulfuras on the platform. The impact of Sulfuras inflicts $98708s1 Fire damage to any player within $98708A1 yards of the impact, and creates several Lava Waves which move out from the point of impact."},
			{id=2642,title="Lava Wave",body="If a player touches a moving Lava Wave, the lava inflicts $98928s1 Fire damage, $98928s2 Fire damage every $98928t2 sec. for $98928d., and knocks the player back."},
			{id=2643,title="Engulfing Flame",body="Ragnaros periodically engulfs a random third of the platform in flames, immediately inflicting $99224s1 Fire damage to players caught in the conflagration then again inflicting $99224s1 Fire damage one second later.",difficultyIDs={14}},
			{id=2644,title="World in Flames",body="Ragnaros periodically casts Engulfing Flames on a random section of the platform every $100171t1 sec for $100171d.",difficultyIDs={15}},
			{id=2645,title="Molten Seed",body="Ragnaros creates Molten Seed at the location of several random players from the nearby lava, inflicting $98498s1 Fire damage to all players within $98498A1 yards of a seed. After $98520d the Molten Seed bursts into a Molten Inferno."},
			{id=2646,title="Molten Inferno",body="When Molten Seeds burst they create a Molten Inferno, inflicting $98518s1 Fire damage to all players and creating a Molten Elemental. The damage inflicted decreases the farther away the player stands from the seed."},
			{id=2647,title="Molten Elemental",body="A Molten Inferno creates a Molten Elemental, which attacks and fixates on a random player."},
			{id=2648,title="Molten Power",body="Molten Elementals within $100158A1 yards empower other Molten Elementals, increasing their damage dealt by $100158s1% and granting immunity to snare and stun effects.",difficultyIDs={5,6,15}},
			{id=3536,title="Magma Blast",body="Ragnaros blasts magma at his current target if he cannot reach and melee them, inflicting $98313s1 Fire damage and increasing Fire damage taken by $98313s2% for $98313d."},
			{id=2649,title="Intermission: Denizens of Flame!",body="At 40% health Ragnaros casts Splitting Blow, burying Sulfuras into the platform and creating Sons of Flame across the platform.  Ragnaros submerges for 45 seconds or until the players destroy all the Sons of Flame, whichever comes first.\n\nRagnaros also creates two Lava Scions that attack the players."},
			{id=2679,title="Splitting Blow",body="Ragnaros buries Sulfuras within the platform, inflicting $100455s1 Fire damage every $100456t1 second to players within $100455A1 yards and creating eight Sons of Flame that attempt to reach the mighty hammer."},
			{id=2650,title="Son of Flame",body="Sons of Flame cross the platform and attempt to reform with Sulfuras. A Son of Flame that reaches Sulfuras causes a Supernova."},
			{id=2651,title="Burning Speed",body="For every 5% of their remaining health above 50%, Sons of Flame move $99414s2% faster. When players reduce a Son of Flame to below 50% remaining health, the Son of Flame loses the Burning Speed effect."},
			{id=2652,title="Supernova",body="When a Son of Flame reaches Sulfuras it explodes in a Supernova, inflicting $99112s1 Fire damage to all players."},
			{id=2653,title="Lava Scion",body="One Lava Scion forms on each side of the platform."},
			{id=2654,title="Blazing Heat",body="A Lava Scion inflicts a random player with Blazing Heat, causing the player to create a trail of Blazing Heat in their wake. Blazing Heat inflicts $99144s1 Fire damage every $99128t1 sec on players standing within the trail, and heals Sons of Flame within the trail for $99145s1% every $99128t1 sec."},
			{id=2655,title="Stage Three: Begone From My Realm!"},
			{id=2656,title="Sulfuras Smash",body="Ragnaros faces the location of a random player and prepares to smash Sulfuras on the platform. The impact of Sulfuras inflicts $98708s1 Fire damage to any player within $98708A1 yards of the impact, and creates several Lava Waves which move out from the point of impact."},
			{id=2657,title="Lava Wave",body="If a player touches a moving Lava Wave, the lava inflicts $98928s1 Fire damage, $98928s2 Fire damage every $98928t2 sec. for $98928d., and knocks the player back."},
			{id=2658,title="Engulfing Flame",body="Ragnaros periodically engulfs a random third of the platform in flames, immediately inflicting $99224s1 Fire damage to players caught in the conflagration then again inflicting $99224s1 Fire damage one second later.",difficultyIDs={14}},
			{id=2659,title="World in Flames",body="Ragnaros periodically casts Engulfing Flames on a random section of the platform every $100171t1 sec for $100171d.",difficultyIDs={5,6,15}},
			{id=2660,title="Summon Living Meteor",body="Ragnaros calls down an increasing number of Living Meteors. The Living Meteor's impact inflicts $99317s1 Fire damage to players within $99317A1 yards of the location."},
			{id=2661,title="Living Meteor",body="The Living Meteor fixates on a random player and chases them."},
			{id=2662,title="Meteor Impact",body="Any player within $99279A1 yards of a Living Meteor triggers a Meteor Impact, inflicting $99287s1 Fire damage to players within $99287A1 yards."},
			{id=2663,title="Combustible",body="Attacking a Living Meteor causes Combustion, knocking it back several yards from the attacking player. Triggering Combustion removes the Combustible effect for 5 seconds."},
			{id=2664,title="Combustion",body="Attacking a Living Meteor causes Combustion, knocking it back several yards from the attacking player.$[!5,6,15\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty Combustion inflicts $100271s1 Fire damage every second for $99303d on the triggering player. This effect stacks.$]"},
			{id=3528,title="Lavalogged",body="If a Living Meteor touches a Lava Wave, the meteor gains the Lavalogged effect for $101088d."},
			{id=3537,title="Magma Blast",body="Ragnaros blasts magma at his current target if he cannot reach and melee them, inflicting $98313s1 Fire damage and increasing Fire damage taken by $98313s2% for $98313d."},
			{id=2665,title="Stage Four: The True Power of the Firelord!",body="The Firelord unleashes his full power and is able to move freely around the platform. Players have the aid of powerful heroes of Azeroth to support them.",difficultyIDs={5,6,15}},
			{id=2680,title="Superheated",body="Ragnaros unleashes his full power and becomes Superheated, inflicting $100594s1 Fire damage every $100593t1 sec. on all players and increasing the damage dealt by Superheated by $100594s2%. This effect stacks."},
			{id=2681,title="Empower Sulfuras",body="Ragnaros channels his flames upon Sulfuras. After $100604d. of channeling, Sulfuras becomes Empowered and Ragnaros' melee attacks unleash the Flames of Sulfuras, inflicting $100630s1 Fire damage to all players."},
			{id=2682,title="Flames of Sulfuras",body="With Sulfuras empowered, Ragnaros' melee attacks unleash the Flames of Sulfuras, inflicting $100630s1 Fire damage to all players."},
			{id=2683,title="Dreadflame",body="Ragnaros stomps and creates a Dreadflame at nearby locations. The Dreadflame multiplies rapidly and spreads across the platform. Dreadflame inflicts $100941s1 Fire damage and $100941s2 Fire damage every $100941t2 sec for $100941d if a player touches the fire."},
			{id=2685,title="Cenarius",body="Although the son of Malorne and Elune, the mighty demigod and druid patron Cenarius was cared for in his youth by the Dragon Aspect Ysera. \n\nCenarius supports the raid by using his powers over nature to freeze Living Meteors and reduce the damage caused when Ragnaros is Superheated."},
			{id=2686,title="Breadth of Frost",body="Cenarius forms a Breadth of Frost at a nearby random location. Any Living Meteors that enter the Breadth of Frost freeze and take $100567s3% additional damage from players. Breadth of Frost grants immunity to Superheated damage and removes the Superheated debuff from players standing within the area."},
			{id=2687,title="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem",body="Apart from being revered by his fellow tauren, the greathearted archdruid Hamuul Runetotem is also a celebrated leader of the Cenarion Circle. \n\nThe wise tauren assists the raid by harnessing nature's fury and causes roots to erupt from the ground to entrap Ragnaros."},
			{id=2688,title="Entrapping Roots",body="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem forms Entrapping Roots at a nearby random location. If Ragnaros enters the area of the Entrapping Roots, he becomes stunned for $100653d and takes $100653s2% additional damage while stunned."},
			{id=2689,title="Malfurion Stormrage",body="One of the most powerful druids ever, Archdruid Malfurion Stormrage has been instrumental in protecting Mount Hyjal from Ragnaros's fiery elemental forces. \n\nThe legendary archdruid helps the raid by protecting heroes from the all-consuming Dreadflame attacks."},
			{id=2690,title="Cloudburst",body="Malfurion forms a Cloudburst. The player who interacts with a Cloudburst becomes surrounded with a Deluge.  Deluge grants the player immunity to Dreadflame damage, and allows the player to extinguish any nearby Dreadflame."},
			{id=2691,title="Deluge",body="The Deluge grants immunity to Dreadflame damage, and allows the player to extinguish any nearby Dreadflame."},
		},
	},
