		sections={
			{id=4027,title="Stage One: Dragonriders, Attack!",body="Flying alongside the Skyfire and surveying the scene while his massive twilight drake lobs balls of destruction at the gunship, Warmaster Blackhorn gives the order for his elite dragonriders to swoop into battle."},
			{id=4202,title="The Skyfire",body="Sky Captain Swayze helms this massive gunship equipped with numerous cannons and a pair of harpoon guns for its defense. The gunship is sturdy but not indestructible, and if it sustains too much damage the pursuit of Deathwing will come to an untimely end."},
			{id=4205,title="Harpoon Guns",body="Alliance engineers equipped the Skyfire with two repurposed harpoon guns, seized during its prior service in Northrend. Harpoon gunners spear the enemy's Assault Drakes and reel them in to bring them within reach of ranged attackers on the deck. The drakes strain against the line, eventually breaking free and returning to a safe distance. After a pause to reload, the harpoon gunners then spear their target anew.$[!7\n\nIn Raid Finder Difficulty, the drakes do not break free from the Harpoons.$]"},
			{id=4356,title="Deck Fire",body="As the Skyfire takes damage, destructive fires break out on the ship and spread rapidly across its deck. Crewmembers rush to extinguish these blazes and keep them in check. Any player standing within a fire suffers $110095s1 Fire damage per second.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=4203,title="Goriona",body="Warmaster Blackhorn takes to the skies with this massive twilight drake."},
			{id=4204,title="Twilight Onslaught",body="Goriona unleashes a massive blast of dark energy at a random location on the deck of the Skyfire. Twilight Onslaught inflicts $%106401s1 Shadow damage, divided evenly among all players within its $106401A1 yard radius and the Skyfire. If the attack strikes the deck of the Skyfire without hitting a player, the gunship suffers the full damage."},
			{id=4357,title="Broadside",body="Goriona periodically unleashes a vicious barrage of fireballs that slam into the side of the Skyfire, causing the ship to suffer damage equal to $110153s1% of its remaining structural integrity.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=4192,title="Twilight Assault Drake",body="These drakes strafe across the deck of the ship, deposit their fierce riders onto the deck, and then retreat to a safe distance to bombard the gunship."},
			{id=4193,title="Twilight Barrage",body="The twilight drakes launch bursts of dark energy at a random location on the deck of the Skyfire. Twilight Barrage inflicts $%107439s1 Shadow damage, divided evenly among all players within its $107439A1 yard radius. If the attack strikes the deck of the Skyfire without hitting a player, the gunship suffers the full damage instead.$[!5,6\n\nOn Heroic Difficulty, Twilight Barrage also increases Shadow damage taken by $107439s2% for $107439d. This effect stacks.$]"},
			{id=4194,title="Twilight Elite Dreadblade"},
			{id=4195,title="Blade Rush",body="The Dreadblade charges at the location of a random distant player, inflicting $%107595s1 Physical damage to all players in its path."},
			{id=4196,title="Degeneration",body="The Dreadblade carves a swath of destruction with its dark sword. The sword inflicts $%107558s1 Shadow damage to enemies in a frontal cone, and $%107558s2 Shadow damage every $107558t2 sec for $107558d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=4197,title="Twilight Elite Slayer"},
			{id=4198,title="Blade Rush",body="The Elite Slayer charges at the location of a random distant player, inflicting $%107595s1 Physical damage to all players in its path."},
			{id=4199,title="Brutal Strike",body="The Slayer strikes a vicious blow with its jagged sword. The strike inflicts $%107567s1% weapon damage, and $%107567s2 Physical damage every $107567t2 sec for $107567d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=4200,title="Twilight Sapper",body="Sleek infiltrator drakes airdrop goblins strapped with powerful explosives onto the deck of the ship. These Sappers rush to breach the gunship bridge and detonate their destructive payload.",difficultyIDs={1,2,3,4,5,6}},
			{id=4201,title="Detonate",body="Upon reaching the Skyfire's bridge, the Sapper detonates his explosives. The blast inflicts $%107518s1 Fire damage to players within $107518A1 yards, damages the Skyfire for $107518s2% of its total durability, and kills the Sapper.",difficultyIDs={1,2,3,4,5,6}},
			{id=4033,title="Stage Two: Looks Like I'm Doing This Myself",body="Once the Skyfire's defenders defeat three waves of dragonriders, Warmaster Blackhorn leaps down onto the deck of the gunship."},
			{id=4034,title="Warmaster Blackhorn"},
			{id=4209,title="Devastate",body="Blackhorn sunders his current target's armor, inflicting $108042s1% weapon damage and reducing the player's armor by $108043s1% for $108043d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=4210,title="Disrupting Roar",body="Warmaster Blackhorn screams fiercely, inflicting $%108044s1 Physical damage to all enemies on the gunship. The shout also interrupts spellcasting for players within $108044A2 yards for $108044d."},
			{id=4211,title="Shockwave",body="Blackhorn strikes the ground, unleashing a wave of force that inflicts $%108046s2 Physical damage to enemies in an $108046a2 yard frontal cone and stuns them for $108046d."},
			{id=4212,title="Vengeance",body="As Warmaster Blackhorn takes damage during the course of the fight, he inflicts 1% more damage for each percentage of his missing health."},
			{id=4363,title="Siphon Vitality",body="When severely injured, Warmaster Blackhorn drains health directly from Goriona. The health drain inflicts damage equal to $110312s1% of Goriona's remaining health, and heals Blackhorn accordingly.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=4206,title="Goriona",body="After depositing her master on the deck of the Skyfire, Goriona hovers alongside the Skyfire and rains destruction down on the players. Once Goriona has suffered sufficient damage, she will break off and flee, abandoning her master on the Skyfire.$[!5,6\n\nOn Heroic mode, upon reaching 90% health, Goriona will land on the Skyfire's deck to assist her master.$]"},
			{id=4208,title="Twilight Flames",body="Goriona launches a blast of dark energy at the location of a random player, inflicting $%108051s1 Shadow damage on impact to players in a $108051A1 yard radius. Twilight Flames lingers on the deck of the Skyfire, inflicting $%108076s1 Shadow damage to players within $108076A1 yards every $108053t1 sec for $108053d."},
			{id=4354,title="Twilight Breath",body="Goriona unleashes a torrent of dark flame, inflicting $110212s1 Shadow damage in a $110212a1 yard cone in front of the caster.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=4355,title="Consuming Shroud",body="Goriona envelops an enemy target in twilight energy, absorbing the next $110214s1 healing received. When Consuming Shroud absorbs incoming healing, unleashed energy will deal damage equal to the healing absorbed to all allies. Dying while afflicted by Consuming Shroud will release all remaining energy at once.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
		},
	},
